WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:16,020
What are you doing? What are you not doing?

2
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,460
This leg has been broken for a long time

3
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,540
The bearings are a bit out of place

4
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,920
I just want to take a break, right? Gardeno

5
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,280
There's going to be a simulated battle soon, right?

6
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,360
I checked the deposit

7
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:25,160
There is still a little bit left over from the land parcels I have saved over the past few years.

8
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,280
I'll transfer it to you later.

9
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:29,880
This is the black iron machine's sacred potion. Where did you get it?

10
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:35,200
Didn’t you go to the underworld Gaolibao?

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,120
Those guys who eat people without spitting out their heads

12
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,320
How dare you mess with moneyless people?

13
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,740
I asked the goblins to dig the soil in God's Domain today

14
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,580
Dig up a piece of high-level relic ore

15
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:48,870
Sold 100,000 faith points for 100,000

16
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:54,620
This medicine can evolve the breath of the abyss

17
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:57,310
You won’t have to rely on strong soju in the middle of the night anymore.

18
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:58,630
Carrying the divine power with strong soup
